  "body": "Release created at  Fri Oct 30 17:50:47 CST 2026\nSynchronize Alpha branch code updates, keeping only the latest version\n<br>\n[\u6211\u5e94\u8be5\u4e0b\u8f7d\u54ea\u4e2a\u6587\u4ef6? / Which file should I download?](https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/wiki/FAQ)\n[\u4e8c\u8fdb\u5236\u6587\u4ef6\u7b5b\u9009 / Binary file selector](https://metacubex.github.io/Meta-Docs/startup/#_1)\n[\u67e5\u770b\u6587\u6863 / Docs](https://metacubex.github.io/Meta-Docs/)\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* chore: allow mieru inbound to actively close idle TCP connection by @enfein in https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/pull/3354\n* fix: prevent SOCKS domain length arithmetic overflow by @SaladDay in https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/pull/3359\n* feat: add ss-password generation functionality to the command line tool by @Zephyruso in https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/pull/3372\n* fix: keep bytes that arrive with the HTTP proxy's CONNECT response by @gtoxlili in https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/pull/3382\n\n## New Contributors\n* @SaladDay made their first contribution in https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/pull/3359\n* @gtoxlili made their first contribution in https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/pull/3382\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/compare/v1.19.33...Prerelease-Alpha",
